## Getting started

Install dependencies:

```bash
uv sync
```

Run the development server:

```bash
uv run fastapi dev src/main.py
```

Run tests:

```bash
uv run pytest
```

Lint:

```bash
uv run ruff check .
```
{{ if or .WithDatabase .WithAuth }}
## Database setup

This project uses PostgreSQL with SQLAlchemy (async) and Alembic migrations.

1. Create the database:

```bash
createdb {{ .Name | replace "-" "_" }}
```

2. Run migrations:

```bash
uv run alembic upgrade head
```

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` if you need to customize `DATABASE_URL`.
{{ end }}
