{{ if .WithOpenai }}
## AI / LLM

Set your API keys in `.env`:

```
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
```

The `/chat` endpoint uses `gpt-4` by default. Change the model in `src/routes/chat.py`.
{{ end }}
